     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi D-RUGies!<div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;display:inline\">D-RUG was started around fall of 2012 and now has 898 members. Thanks to everyone who has participating in one way or another. <span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;display:inline\">This group has been an amazing and supportive community for so many, and in order to keep it going it&#39;s important to have folks willing to maintain and organize our weekly meeting, maintain the website, and arrange for a presentation or two. </span></span><br></div><div><br></div><div>So, I wanted to introduce and welcome two new co-coordinators to D-RUG!  </div><div><br></div><div><b>Taylor Reiter</b> and <b>Martha Wohlfeil</b> have kindly volunteered to help co-coordinate, so please keep your eyes peeled for future emails/communication from them. They are both awesome and have been consistent participants and helpers at the weekly D-RUG meetings.</div><div><br></div>Taylor is a 2nd year graduate student in the Food Science graduate group at UC Davis. She studies how microbes survive in and change the metabolite profile of olive oil. She has experience wrangling genomic data, building websites, and using git in R.<div><br></div><div>Martha is a 2nd year graduate student in the ecology department at UC Davis. She studies avian biogeography in the Great Basin and has experience building statistical models and working with mapping software.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks and hope to see some of you on Mondays!</div><div><br></div><div>Adios,<br>Ryan</div><div><br></div><div>(now just <i>one</i> of the Co-coordinators of D-RUG!)</div><div><br></div><div><br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div>-- <br><div data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;display:inline!important;float:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span> </span></span><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"></b></i></font></span><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><font size=\"1\"><i>&quot;When we try to pick out anything by itself, we find it hitched to everything else in the universe.&quot;<b><br>John Muir (My First Summer in the Sierra, 1911)</b></i></font></div><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b>-----------------------------------------------------</b></i></font></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;line-height:19px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><div>Ryan Peek</div><div>PhD Candidate, Graduate Group in Ecology<br></div><div dir=\"ltr\">Center for Watershed Sciences, UC Davis</div></font></span><div style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><div><b style=\"color:rgb(11,83,148);font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif\"><i><a href=\"http://ryanpeek.github.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ryanpeek.github.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466553303000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3B9NHJLYZrcTSDoQMAmsoL\">ryanpeek.github.io</a></i></b><br></div><div><b style=\"color:rgb(11,83,148);font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif\">@riverpeek</b></div></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif\"><a href=\"tel:(530)%20754-5351\" value=\"+15307545351\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">530.754.5351</a> </span><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;fon